        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memory Keeper is a soothing interior design simulator where you create and save perfect rooms filled with your memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just relax and create. Arrange furniture, choose colors, and add decorative touches to create the atmosphere of your most cherished moments—from the sunny living room in your first apartment to the cozy nook of your grandmother's house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your personal digital space for creativity and cozy memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create without limits: Intuitive editor with quick selection of furniture and decor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preserve moments: Take photorealistic screenshots of your room and collect memories in a personal album.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic aesthetics: A visual style that balances realism with soft, charming graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure relaxation: No rush, tasks, or secrets. Just you, thinking about your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your perfect cozy space. Become the keeper of your memories.</p>",
